{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tukoni: Forest Keepers is a cute &amp; cozy puzzle adventure, based on a series of award-winning books by the Ukrainian artist Oksana Bula. Play as the forest spirit Tukoni as you meet unique characters, solve captivating puzzles, brew fragrant tea and explore a magical world filled with kindness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723540/extras/6accc67707e470793762915fdb3f3435.poster.avif?t=1754560906\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723540/extras/6accc67707e470793762915fdb3f3435.webm?t=1754560906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723540/extras/6accc67707e470793762915fdb3f3435.mp4?t=1754560906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>In Tukoni: Forest Keepers demo:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as The Traveller, the Tukoni embarking on a bigger journey than ever before </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore Sycamore, a cozy corner where forest keepers Tukoni prepare for winter\u2019s arrival </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve cozy puzzles and vibe with whimsical characters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend about 30 minutes in our lovingly illustrated, hand-crafted world</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Mushroom Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3723540/9a82af53a240b51df7196009607f3c5d610ccf54.jpg"},{"name":"Backpacker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3723540/d1954d986aff1bed3e9b3aba127c030ac41554c2.jpg"},{"name":"Lunch Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3723540/a93c9ecb36b09debe2389da